    "title": "Coulee Region Humane Society celebrates National Puppy Day, shows off new adoptions",
    "text": "Current Time 0:00Duration 0:12Remaining Time 0:12LA CROSSE (WKBT) -- The Coulee Region Humane Society is celebrating National Puppy Day, which is March 23, showcasing off their new puppies available for adoption.The shelter recently welcomed a group of puppies from other rescues and now has eight adorable pups looking for forever homes.Matt Dougherty, Marketing & Graphic Design Coordinator for the Coulee Region Humane Society, says the bunch are particularly popular.\"We have 8 puppies still available; I think we had 10-11 earlier on, but they're going pretty quick. They're really cute. Honestly, the best part about the puppies is they're so playful, they have not a care in the world. They jump and play and fall all over each other and they're just absolutely adorable.\"The adoption fee is $350 dollars, plus a $100 dollar training deposit, which is returned after the owner completes puppy training classes. Dougherty adds that the training deposit is incentive to help owners make sure they have all the tools they need to take home a high-energy animal. \"Puppies are a lot. They're mischievous, and they're learning how to go to the bathroom outside, they're learning how to behave inside, and so they're a handful for sure, but it's a cute handful.\" He adds more of the puppies will be good with other pets, since they're so young and behaviors can be easily taught at that time. \"Most of them will be good with your housecat, most of them will be good with another dog, they're kind of entering the world and don't have a lot of opinions and issues already set forward. So, it's kind of fun to be able to have them, literally bring them up within your family.\"The full roster of adoptable pets from CRHS can be found here.More information can be found on the Coulee Region Humane Society website.​COPYRIGHT 2026 BY NEWS 8 NOW/NEWS 8000. ALL RIGHTS RESERVED. THIS MATERIAL MAY NOT BE PUBLISHED, BROADCAST, REWRITTEN OR REDISTRIBUTED. Top Videos",
